<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Roblox LT2 Blue wood maze automated</Major>
    <Description>Hello! I made this script to autonavigate the Blue wood maze, enjoy :)

To use: Must have your keyboard on AZERTY (so you move left with Q and forward with Z)

2nd: Stand in the left entrance, and just let it run!

Enjoy :)</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы

:) </Comment>
